1,0.014,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.002,0.003,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"Unfortunately, you find no ship's carpenter sawing down trees, though in the right frame of mind the branches of this tree look like a ship's mast and rigging that got drunk; it reminds you of two galleons you once saw that were hopelessly entwined during a battle. The crew of one filled the other with holes, but couldn't free their own ship before both sank beneath the waves. Then you swooped in and took all the bounty for yourself.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":26.528,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":79,"words":79},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":26.528,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":79,"words":79},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Good times.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.68,"end":28.8,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"large":{"start":27.68,"end":28.28,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"differ":true},{"i":2,"text":"As you admire the tree, you could almost imagine a monkey scurrying across it. Hold on a minute – that is a monkey! A gold-brown Senegal monkey with white whiskers.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":29.408,"end":39.904,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"large":{"start":29.408,"end":39.78,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Having a monkey on board a ship is considered good luck, as well as entertainment for the crew.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":40.256,"end":45.088,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"large":{"start":40.256,"end":45.088,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"You simply must have a photo with it for your pirate coat of arms! Then everyone who sees it will know luck is on your side.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":45.568,"end":53.792,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":26,"words":26},"large":{"start":45.568,"end":53.792,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":26,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92b2daec30_PC%20JM7.png"}